    <p>
      I'm Martí, a <strong>Telecommunications Engineer</strong> from Barcelona who has been working with
      <strong>generative AI since 2019</strong>, long before it was everywhere. I started doing research on GANs for interior
      design, and that prototype turned into
      <a href="https://stageinhome.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">StageInHome</a>, the startup I co-founded
      and where I led all the AI for almost five years.
    </p>
    <p>
      Along the way I've trained <strong>diffusion models</strong>, built <strong>production APIs</strong> and set up
      <strong>auto-scaling AI services on AWS</strong>. Later, as AI Lead at
      <a href="https://napptilus.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Napptilus Tech Labs</a>, I led a
      multidisciplinary team shipping <strong>LLM and RAG solutions</strong> for clients in many different industries.
    </p>
    <p>
      Today I'm <strong>AI Lead at <a href="https://www.driverevel.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">REVEL</a></strong>,
      where I define the AI strategy and build <strong>agents and AI infrastructure</strong> that people actually use every
      day. What I enjoy most is finding the simplest AI solution that has a real impact, and then making it reliable in
      production.
    </p>
    <p>
      When I'm not building, I write about AI on my
      <a href="https://martigrau.notion.site/mgrau-Blog-696cd1b98c62455d8bf6cbff96ba0bae" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">blog</a>.
